BESSEL FUNCTIONS OF FRACTIONAL ORDER (p.43)
10.2. Modified Spherical Bessel Functions Definitions Differential Equation
10.2.1  \rho^{2}w^{\prime}+2wp^{\prime}-[z^{2}+n(n+1)]w=0  (n=0, \pm 1, \pm 2, \ldots)

Particular solutions are the _Modified Spherical Bessel functions of the first kind,_
10.2.2  \sqrt{12\pi/z}I_{n+1}(z)=e^{-n\pi i/2}j_{n}(ze^{\pi t/2})  (-\pi<\arg z\leq\tfrac{1}{2}\pi)  =e^{\beta w\pi t/2}j_{n}(ze^{-3\pi t/2})  (\tfrac{1}{2}\pi<\arg z\leq\pi)
of the second kind,
10.2.3  \sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n+1}(z)=e^{5(n+1)\pi i/3}y_{n}(ze^{\pi t/2})  (-\pi<\arg z\leq\tfrac{1}{2}\pi)
