of the third kind,
10.2.4  \sqrt{3\pi/z}K_{n+1}(z)=\tfrac{1}{2}\pi(-1)^{n+1}\sqrt{2\pi/z}[I_{n+1}(z)-I_{-n-1}(z)]
The pairs
\sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{s+1}(z),\sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{-n-1}(z) and
\sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n+1}(z),\sqrt{3\pi/z}K_{n+1}(z) are linearly independent solutions for every n.

Most properties of the Modified Spherical Bessel functions can be derived from those of the Spherical Bessel functions by use of the above relations.
